          "text": "The cruelest part of regret is not losing everything.\n\nIt is getting the dream.\nThe applause.\nThe beautiful, respectable life you once fought for.\nAnd then, one night, when a piano begins to play, you realize that the one person you wanted to share it all with is no longer by your side.\nThis time, Deadpool crashes into the ending of La La Land.\n\nHe is not here to erase the classic ending.\nHe is not here to say Mia and Seb made the wrong choice.\n\nHe simply opens another branch of the multiverse — one where they no longer have to pretend that being mature means staying silent.\n\nIn this version, Mia and Seb finally say the words they buried beneath success, distance, and time:\n“I don’t want you to leave my life.”\n\nA tribute to dreams, timing, regret, and the impossible fantasy of choosing love one more time.\n\n#LaLaLand #Deadpool #RyanGosling #EmmaStone #FilmEdit #MovieEdit #CinematicEdit #VideoEssay #FanEdit #Dreamers #SomeoneInTheCrowd\n\nOriginal Creator / 原作者：\n https://t.co/w6c8Lov6Fg\nEnglish Subtitles / 视频英文字幕：@YongQuan\n\nAll characters and IP rights belong to their respective copyright holders.\nThis work is an AI fan creation and tribute only.\n\nEnjoy the video."
